  "description": "\"For three years, I killed myself trying to please you. Let's break up.\" \n\nYou dared to love me, someone without a presence. Others were kind to me only to look good to you. Everything was boring.\n\nHui-Jae, tired of a relationship without sincerity, broke up with So-Min... But a year later, he meets So-Min again by chance at college. And Eun-Jun, the guy Hui-Jae likes, seems interested in So-Min...!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
